Error [E0914]: unknown interpolation selector `:Repr`
  --> tests/ui/debug_unknown_selector.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     print("{x:Repr}")
    |               ^^^^
 Why: string interpolation supports a closed selector set — use `:Debug`, `:Pretty`, `:Fixed(n)`, or `:Unit(name|bare)`
 Fix: write `{value:Debug}`, `{value:Pretty}`, `{value:Fixed(2)}`, `{value:Unit(name)}` or `{value:Unit(bare)}`, or `{value}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0914
